{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7.5 out of 12 levels</strong>, including both introductory stages and more challenging ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 visual skins</strong> for the ball (temporarily unlocked during the demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full physics and controls</strong> \u2014 rolling, jumping, acceleration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your playstyle: <strong>explore at your own pace or go for speedruns</strong>, with no randomness or scripted events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress saving</strong> \u2014 everything you complete in the demo will carry over to the full version if you purchase it</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo limitations:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all levels and content are available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret objects (like the ducks) are currently disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetic skins do <strong>not</strong> affect physics or gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707260?t=1747403795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707260/7ddb9a55896d55d7400588f1ac37ceee93cc4b9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747403795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707260/f14f8b3291f86ce59612eb26a209baf306f9a0fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747403795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707260/f14f8b3291f86ce59612eb26a209baf306f9a0fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747403795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Included in the demo:</stron